Input type: {image_type}. A GIF is shown as a collage of key frames. Use all frames to understand the action.
Generate two groups of short sticker tags, with at most five tags per group.
emotion_tags describes the sender's likely emotion or tone, such as resignation, self-mockery, or agreement. Leave it empty if unclear.
content_tags describes visible characters, objects, actions, or text, such as cat, facepalm, or the visible words “Here we go again”. Include at least one and avoid guessing identities or background.
Output only a JSON object with emotion_tags and content_tags, both arrays of strings.
